5,1,1,talk,Misaki,,We need a system that doesn't create tension between neighbors. Let's be careful.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I agree, dear. It's a bit crowded down there lately, isn't it?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,It is! But let's be practical. We need to know if we can actually afford any changes.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,George,,We also need to consider who will actually manage the system once we decide.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mio,,I just want it to be fair! Some people always seem to get the best spots.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Mio, fairness is good, but not if it makes people stop talking to each other.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I wonder if the bikes are actually getting damaged in the rush.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,Exactly. And what about the money? Does the building even have a budget for this?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,George,,I'm more worried about the paperwork. I don't want another failed project.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mio,,"But if we don't check the history, we're just guessing who has what!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I'll look into the past complaints and how other buildings handled this.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I'll check the morning rush and the rain exposure.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,I'm going for the ledger and the station park rates.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,George,,I'll check the treasurer's files and the supplier's frame.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Mio,,I'll look at the minutes and the sticker register!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
