31,2,,status,George,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
32,2,,status,Shizue,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
33,2,,status,Mio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
34,2,,status,Misaki,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,Misaki,,The neighboring block had people stop attending meetings over fees. That's a warning.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,It's quite a mess. People are shifting other bikes just to leave in the morning.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,The building account is nearly empty. We can't afford upgrades without a new income source.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,George,,Those double-tier racks are a nightmare to maintain and hard to use.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Mio,,It's true! The same flats have held the best spots for five years without review.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Mio, that explains the resentment, but we must avoid a system that breeds more.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shizue,,And the rain! The bikes past the downpipe are getting soaked. It's not fair.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,The station park is expensive. People would likely pay us if it's cheaper.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,George,,But the treasurer already spends hours on small collections. More billing is a burden.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Mio,,Daily riders actually said they'd prefer to pay for a guaranteed spot!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"@May, if we charge, we risk the social friction I saw in the other block.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"If we just let everyone share, will the shoving matches stop or get worse?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,"If we don't charge, we can't fix the rain issue or the layout.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,George,,I can't support anything that adds hours of monthly paperwork to the association.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Mio,,A lottery would be the fairest way to break the five-year streak of the same people.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"A lottery is neutral, but it doesn't solve the physical crowding.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shizue,,I just want everyone to be able to leave without a struggle.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,May,,Money solves the budget and the demand. It's the most professional way.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,George,,"As long as the administration is minimal, I can be flexible.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Mio,,Let's see the options and decide based on these facts.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,,status,May,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
