60,3,1,talk,Misaki,,Option A seems risky for our harmony. B is chaotic. C is neutral.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"Shared racks in Option B might stop the ""my spot"" arguments, but the shoving?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,May,,Option A is perfect. It generates funds and filters by those who truly need it.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,George,,"Option C is the easiest to manage. One draw a year, then you're done.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Mio,,I love Option C! It completely resets the unfairness of the last five years.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, the neighboring block's experience makes me strongly oppose Paid Allocation.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@George, would a lottery solve the rain exposure issue? Someone still gets the wet spot.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,May,,But Option A allows us to fund a cover for the rain!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,George,,"@May, who is going to collect that money every month? Not me.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Mio,,A lottery is fair because everyone accepts the risk of the wet spot.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Misaki,,I'll vote for the lottery. It's the least likely to cause long-term grudges.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"I worry about the racks in B, so I'll go with the lottery too.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,May,,I still think we're missing a financial opportunity. I'm sticking with A.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,George,,I'm voting for C. Low maintenance is the only way it lasts.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Mio,,Definitely C! It's the only way to be truly equal.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
